tps://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031437_1194437931592901_3877599479731641564_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LWPlAkTLnAAQ7kNvwE3wr4y&_nc_oc=AdqVFzqRCAj8GdW-QFSPepOwOjmgdRk9S2SQ87qPHVDxusSkwDtegg5hpu9pnwF67L8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR5_BvvL-R8DNQZgMh4S3UKA3ow9HfEKexQmn_fSANw6w&oe=6B0867E4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\u4e88\u544a\u7de8\u30ab\u30d0\u30fc\u753b\u50cf.png", "id": "1012028274054504", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75258663_1012028277387837_7425862253591877070_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XlKpBJhhXZkQ7kNvwEnVZY4&_nc_oc=Adp4nz0IEDvCzZd5Tpi9xBf6kQ-09tOomdBKzjZKAZ1fHXRwq8lP0gp0JEhPDJ9Wp3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrJrfpAaXn2PxzuT-IS68rf7Yzo9EQHyf-ZoHdW686Ew&oe=6B0851FF"}, "display_name": "SWORD BISTRO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Ingredients Fly Through the Air, and AI Cooks Them!?**\n\nAll the player has to do is slice the ingredients with a sword. \n\nIt's a super easy rhythm action game!\n\n\n**Slice Ingredients Simultaneously! Freshness Up, Meow!**\n\nIf you slice three ingredients simultaneously with perfect timing, the quality of the dish will improve.\n\n\n**Create One-of-a-Kind Dishes!**\n\nThe final dish varies each time based on the sliced ingredients, making it addictive. An image-generating AI using ChatGPT creates unique dishes.\n\n\n**Share Your Finished Dishes on Social Media!**\n\nIs the completed dish delicious-looking? Or perhaps a bit unusual and mysterious? \n\nPost it on social media and have fun with your friends and followers!\n\n**Would you like to grab a sword and enjoy fantasy cooking with cats?**\n{1216381432717385}\n{815571697349553}\n{870447028275041}", "short_description": "Slice and Dice with Ease! Create Fantasy Dishes with AI.\nSimply chop ingredients to